{%- when 'emerald' -%}
  <div class="gem-about">
    <p><strong>Planet:</strong> ☿ Budh (Mercury)</p>
    <p><strong>Governs:</strong> Intellect, communication, memory, analysis, discernment, and expressive clarity</p>
    <p>Emerald, known as Panna, is a gemstone deeply associated with the planet Mercury (Budh), which represents intelligence, speech, logic, and decision-making. Because of this strong connection, Panna is believed to enhance mental clarity, improve communication skills, and bring sharper focus in both personal and professional life.</p>
    <p>This gemstone is especially valued for its ability to support calm, structured thinking. Rather than overwhelming the mind, Emerald works by refining it — helping thoughts become clearer, more organised, and easier to express. It is often recommended for individuals who rely heavily on intellect and articulation in their daily lives.</p>
    <p>Emerald aligns with Mercury's energy to promote balanced expression and thoughtful decision-making. It encourages clarity in communication, steadiness in judgment, and a more composed inner rhythm. It is not a gemstone of force, but one of quiet refinement and precision.</p>
    <p>It is particularly suited for students, writers, analysts, advisors, traders, and professionals who need to think clearly and communicate effectively under pressure. By reducing mental restlessness and scattered attention, Emerald supports articulate confidence and a more focused state of mind.</p>
  </div>
{%- when 'blue-sapphire' -%}
  <div class="gem-about">
    <p><strong>Planet:</strong> ♄ Shani (Saturn) </p>
    <p><strong>Governs:</strong> Discipline, responsibility, justice, stability, and long-term growth</p>
    <p>Blue Sapphire, known as Neelam, is a powerful gemstone deeply associated with the planet Saturn (Shani), which represents karma, structure, perseverance, and responsibility. Because of this strong connection, Neelam is believed to bring mental stability, enhance focus, and support more decisive progress in both personal and professional life.</p>
    <p>This gemstone is known for its ability to instill discipline and clarity. Rather than creating intensity, Blue Sapphire works by grounding the mind — helping reduce confusion and bringing a sense of order, composure, and direction. It is often chosen by individuals who carry significant responsibilities and aim to build long-term, meaningful success.</p>
    <p>Blue Sapphire aligns with Saturn's energy to support resilience, steady progress, and thoughtful decision-making. It encourages clarity, strengthens determination, and promotes a structured approach to challenges and opportunities alike.</p>
    <p>It is particularly suited for those who lead with patience and accountability — professionals, entrepreneurs, and individuals focused on sustained growth. By reducing fear, scattered thinking, and indecision, Blue Sapphire supports confidence, stability, and a more disciplined state of mind.</p>
    <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #c53030; margin-top: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> Wear only after proper testing and expert astrological consultation. Blue Sapphire is considered a powerful gemstone, and suitability should always be confirmed first.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- when 'opal' -%}
