    <p><strong>Planet:</strong> ♀ Shukra (Venus) </p>
    <p><strong>Governs:</strong> Beauty, harmony, relationships, creativity, comfort, refined pleasures, self-worth, and attraction</p>
    <p>Opal is a gemstone deeply associated with the planet Venus (Shukra), which represents love, aesthetics, creativity, and emotional fulfillment. Because of this connection, Opal is believed to enhance personal charm, improve emotional balance, and strengthen one's sense of self-worth and attraction.</p>
    <p>This gemstone is known for its gentle and uplifting energy. Rather than intensity, Opal brings softness — helping to ease emotional friction, restore harmony, and add a sense of lightness to one's thoughts and experiences. It is often chosen by individuals who want to bring more creativity, beauty, and emotional flow into their lives.</p>
    <p>Opal aligns with Venus's energy to support confidence, creativity, and harmonious relationships. It encourages emotional openness, refined expression, and a stronger connection to pleasure, comfort, and self-appreciation.</p>
    <p>It is particularly suited for those seeking balance in relationships, creative growth, and a renewed sense of joy and attraction in life. By reducing emotional heaviness and self-doubt, Opal supports ease, elegance, and a more expressive state of being.</p>
    <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #c53030; margin-top: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> Wear only after proper consultation with a qualified Vedic astrologer. Opal is a Venus gemstone, and suitability should always be confirmed before wearing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
