    <p>Ruby is a gemstone deeply associated with the Sun (Surya), the source of energy, identity, and direction. Because of this strong connection, Ruby is believed to strengthen confidence, restore decisiveness, and bring clarity rooted in a strong sense of self.</p>
    <p>This gemstone works by amplifying inner strength rather than creating external force. It supports individuals in reclaiming confidence when it has diminished and encourages action with clarity and conviction. Ruby is not about overpowering others — it is about no longer diminishing yourself.</p>
    <p>Ruby aligns with the Sun's energy to promote leadership, courage, and a clear sense of purpose. It encourages assertiveness, strengthens willpower, and helps bring direction where uncertainty or hesitation may exist.</p>
    <p>It is particularly suited for leaders, entrepreneurs, executives, public figures, and individuals in roles where presence and decision-making are essential. By reducing self-doubt and hesitation, Ruby supports authority, confidence, and a more empowered way of showing up in life.</p>
